//!
//! A thematic break (horizontal rule) is a line consisting of three or more
//! matching `-`, `_`, or `*` characters, optionally with spaces between them.
//!
//! # Examples
//!
//! ```markdown
//! ---
//! ***
//! ___
//! - - -
//! *  *  *
//! ```

